{
  "bodyHash": "+O09skngric=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Minecraft-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.17 | 1.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 关于：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Stylish Effects</strong> 彻底改变了状态效果的显示方式。它提供了多种模式供选择，以及无数可配置选项，让你能够打造理想的效果显示界面。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首先，简陋的原版HUD效果显示被替换为更高级的版本，其中包含了效果计时器和当前效果等级。现在，这种显示方式也同样应用于物品栏中，因为它更加紧凑，允许显示更多的效果而不会重叠。而且这种新的物品栏显示不再局限于玩家的物品栏，你现在可以在任何容器中看到你活跃的效果！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">但等等，既然状态效果现在以紧凑的方式只显示图标，那你怎么知道你的活跃效果叫什么名字呢？别担心，我们已经添加了一个方便的提示工具。当安装了 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions</strong></span></a>（由 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>MehVahdJukaar</strong></span></a> 制作）时，这个提示工具会变得更有用。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你喜欢原版的物品栏状态效果显示，想保留它，甚至将其用在HUD上？没问题！你可以选择任意的小部件模式，或者甚至不选择任何模式。除此之外，还有许多可配置的选项，例如效果在屏幕上的位置、行数和列数、自定义透明度、文本颜色、自定义屏幕位置等等。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒体：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/288/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/290/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Stylish Effects 在运行中非常时尚</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>可以选择和配置各种效果渲染类型</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/291/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/292/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>紧凑的效果显示替换了物品栏内的原版显示</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>效果显示出现在每一个容器中，而不仅仅是物品栏</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/293/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/294/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>当鼠标悬停在效果小部件上时，会显示有用的提示工具</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>如此多的可设置选项，打造属于你自己的效果显示</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/295/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>出色的 JEI 和 REI 兼容性</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题解答：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Forge 上配置这个模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安装我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，然后在游戏中直接进行配置！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Fabric 上配置这个模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>直接在游戏中编辑配置尚未实现。请在世界中使用 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 命令，选择 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取决于模组），然后点击聊天中出现的文件名（以 .toml 结尾），即可在单独的编辑器中手动编辑配置文件。保存文件后，配置会在几秒后自动在游戏中重新加载，因此无需重启游戏。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：在哪里可以下载适用于 Minecraft 1.19 之前版本的 Fabric 版模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>旧版本下载可在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>旧项目页面</strong></span></a> 找到。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开发 Stylish Effects 的灵感和帮助来自：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/deadzoke\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Deadzoke</strong></span></a> 以其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ignitehud\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ignite HUD</span></a> 模组激发效果持续时间显示</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dmitrylovin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Dmitrylovin</strong></span></a> 以其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory HUD+</span></a> 模组激发紧凑效果等级显示</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mag_icus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mag_icus</strong></span></a> 以其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/status-effect-timer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Status Effect Timer</span></a> 模组激发紧凑效果持续时间显示</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/snownee_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Snownee</strong></span></a> 提供的小技巧用于禁用默认 JEI 物品栏状态效果处理，源自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mini Effects</span></a> 模组</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs 0212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
